  <!-- 24x24 stroke icons (Lucide, ISC licence). Used through Path.ico, which strokes them with the current text colour. The leading "M2 2M22 22" is invisible: it makes every icon's bounds the same square, because a Uniform-stretched Path is top-left aligned in its box and would otherwise sit off-centre. -->
